Third-party and ported code:

  1. 8een (https://github.com/hamr0/8een, Apache-2.0, same author) — the
     challenge nonce, single-use spend, verdict, and in-memory store patterns
     are ported into packages/chiproof (challenge.js, verdict.js,
     stores/memory.js).

  2. zkPassport circuits (https://github.com/zkpassport/circuits,
     Apache-2.0) — packages/chiproof/src/plugs/zk-passport-params.json is
     derived by executing their age circuit's Poseidon2 parameter
     commitment. The `service_scope`/`service_subscope` field rule used by
     packages/chiproof/src/plugs/zk-passport.js is defined by this project
     (FR12 registry, `zk-passport/1`) and is deliberately interoperable with
     the field derivation used by zkPassport's tooling, established by
     checking our derivation against the public inputs of real proofs
     (spikes/m1-zk). No code from `@zkpassport/utils` is included; that
     package declares no license.
